Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Trouble’s Brewing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 15
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.38,0:12:16.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.59,0:00:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,let me go
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.87,0:00:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you were a good person before
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.87,0:00:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn’t expect you to be a big bad guy who kidnaps children.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.10,0:00:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,save me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.18,0:00:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You bad guy, let her go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.35,0:00:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I advise you not to meddle in other people’s business
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.55,0:00:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,or
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.47,0:00:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Just pretend you didn’t see it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.59,0:00:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,how?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.26,0:00:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,say it again
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.38,0:00:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Let her go
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.58,0:00:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Really love to be a hero
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.70,0:00:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye then
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.46,0:00:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,A boy who doesn’t know the heights of the world
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.84,0:01:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle, the boy is not going to hold back
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.11,0:01:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.23,0:01:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,my doll
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.86,0:01:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? It’s too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.82,0:02:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Get it and go quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.82,0:02:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,who are you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.93,0:02:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you act wild in my place
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.27,0:02:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up, our names are Weslie
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.71,0:02:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,and Wolffy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.34,0:02:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s okay now
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.22,0:02:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.46,0:02:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You said before that that man is not your father
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.02,0:02:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.54,0:02:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom said you can’t talk to strangers
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.29,0:02:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But we are all good people
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.63,0:02:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.59,0:02:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You look like one
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.62,0:02:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,bad guy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.15,0:02:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you can tell me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.46,0:02:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for helping me get the doll
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.87,0:03:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But you catch me
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.10,0:03:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Also a bad guy
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.22,0:03:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems she won’t say anything
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.06,0:03:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie are you hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.30,0:03:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, I’m really hungry
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.10,0:03:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So what shall we eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.82,0:03:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Grass cakes, vanilla pancakes
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.94,0:03:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,and delicious seaweed soup
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.47,0:03:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go do the quest to exchange for food.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.19,0:03:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,wait for me
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.86,0:03:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,boss, bad
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.50,0:04:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiao Mei was kidnapped
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.78,0:04:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,useless stuff
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.49,0:04:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing can be done well
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.07,0:04:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Who ruined my good deeds?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.94,0:04:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.54,0:04:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue Scarf who destroys the city alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.26,0:04:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.50,0:04:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,They seem to be called Weslie and Wolffy
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.30,0:04:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What a nobody?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.94,0:04:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What a nobody?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.93,0:04:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,dares to disturb me
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.21,0:04:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is my majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.73,0:04:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.65,0:04:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, please spare me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.60,0:04:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You must bring that Xiao Mei back to me
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.12,0:04:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Guaranteed completion of tasks
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.42,0:04:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Collect parts to exchange for food
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.37,0:04:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Collect parts to exchange for food
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.54,0:05:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We just dug out this few parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.10,0:05:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,look
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.82,0:05:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I dug up so many parts
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.58,0:05:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This time we
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.10,0:05:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,can definitely have a full meal
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.90,0:05:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Very good
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.03,0:05:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What, that’s all?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.75,0:05:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Really
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.71,0:05:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So many parts in exchange for so little food?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.86,0:05:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be nice if we could have something to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.23,0:05:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Then eat quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.94,0:05:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it all to me. Aren’t you hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.70,0:05:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m just a woolen doll. I don’t need to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.81,0:05:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m not hungry either
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.75,0:06:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s eat together
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.18,0:06:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Running away in fear all day long
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.65,0:06:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s been a while since I sat down for a full meal
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.49,0:06:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you running away?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.17,0:06:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do those bad guys want to catch you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.30,0:06:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I used to live well with my mother
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.90,0:06:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows one day
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.07,0:06:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Guangzong’s men suddenly broke into my house
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.06,0:06:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Smashed and rummaged
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.01,0:06:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom plays a game with you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.17,0:06:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom believes you can do it
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.85,0:07:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Found them. They’re here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.80,0:07:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Knock the door open quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.21,0:07:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll deal with them
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.41,0:07:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You go to that place first and wait for me
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.22,0:07:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.93,0:07:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But not long after
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.17,0:07:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The bad guys found me soon
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.38,0:07:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep chasing me
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.50,0:07:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But my mom is still there waiting for me
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.46,0:07:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I must go to the place agreed with my mom
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.89,0:07:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This doll is my most precious thing
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.25,0:07:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I give the doll as payment
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.01,0:07:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Please escort me to that place
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.88,0:07:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.04,0:07:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.80,0:07:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We are both hungry now
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.85,0:07:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Not solving the problem of eating
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.48,0:07:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,She is also starving and suffering even if she follows us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.68,0:08:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,How about we take her to a safe place first?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.61,0:08:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s take a long-term view later
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.48,0:08:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally found you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.44,0:08:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s the robber from before
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.08,0:08:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Run quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.77,0:08:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t even think about escaping from me again
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.05,0:08:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Catch them quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.17,0:08:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He is much stronger than before
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.84,0:09:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I advise you to surrender obediently.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.40,0:09:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Our boss’s favorite prey
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.53,0:09:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can take it away
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.73,0:09:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,She’s not prey, she’s free
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.52,0:09:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to catch such a kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.44,0:09:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Where has your conscience gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.33,0:09:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.44,0:09:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,How many bottles of water is conscience worth?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.85,0:09:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Run quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.04,0:09:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You can’t escape
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.52,0:09:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sleep together in this desert
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.88,0:09:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.72,0:09:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.24,0:10:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.32,0:10:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry, everyone has a share
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.40,0:10:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie, get out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.88,0:10:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.01,0:10:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,this time
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.57,0:10:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me protect you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.07,0:10:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.85,0:10:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,who is
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.25,0:10:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a powerful attack? Is it
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.84,0:10:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sand Shadow
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.84,0:10:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it’s them. run quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.86,0:11:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn it, I’ll be back
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.82,0:11:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What a nostalgic line
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.85,0:11:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,thank you for saving us
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.99,0:11:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,this weapon
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.06,0:11:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They are the highest reward?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.02,0:11:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you? Let go of Xiao Mei
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.80,0:11:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Weslie
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.59,0:12:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiao Mei
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.70,0:12:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiao Mei, I promise you now
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.78,0:12:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I will definitely take you to your destination
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
